# Soundness regime — a harness configuration constant, not a code change

The harness's soundness constant changed on 2026-09-03 from `CapacityBound` (rows `…-n5` in
`bench/data/cells-plonky3.csv`, `bench/systems/plonky3/RESULTS.md` §5) to `UniqueDecoding`
(rows `…-n6`, `RESULTS.md` §6, `G-13b′`), because `CapacityBound` rests on the mutual
correlated-agreement-up-to-capacity conjecture, which Crites and Stewart, ePrint 2025/2046
(<https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/2046>, rev. 2025-12-19), disprove. The pinned commit above did
not change between the two runs. Both sets of rows are kept in the CSV and labelled — neither
is deleted or silently superseded.
